      "content": "Mooncorona - Version 4.17 Test Build Update Notes \n\u3010New Content\u3011\n\u2022 Added acquisition methods for [Forge Crystal] items: \nObtain [Forge Crystal I/II/III] through combat drops from [Enthralling Hunter], [Enthralling Bladedancer], [Enthralling Sylvan Speaker], [Ironclad Tortoise].\n\u3010Bug Fixes\u3011 \n\u2022 Fixed missing hit reactions from Warrior's starting weapon attacks\n\u2022 Resolved absent impact effects when using [Shield Bash] card\n\u2022 Corrected card selection failure in [Contingency Plan] activation\n\u2022 Fixed abnormal tag highlight effects in storage interface\n\u2022 Addressed softlock during [Ancient Arboreal Guardian] boss encounter\n\u2022 Removed faulty invisible walls in [Kormella Forest] zones\n\u3010Optimizations & Adjustments\u3011 \n\u2022 Enhanced environmental art assets in specific [Lost Cathedral] scenes\nApril 17 - Budaolong Studio",
      "key": "3609290::6a872939eea84ca452367993d0b0205a6d464160",
